*

!.gitignore
!*.c
!*.py
!topaz_imu/
!topaz_imu/*
!setup_nat*
!setup_webcam.sh
!display_demo.sh
!setup_webcam_standalone.sh
!grafana_ui_backup/
!grafana_ui_backup/*
!*.html
!index/
!index/*
!set_up_proxy_server.md
!installation.md

# Dependency manifests + launchers for the per-app virtualenvs. Needed
# explicitly because line 1 ignores everything by default.
!requirements-*.txt
!run_hpc.sh
!run_topaz2.sh
!remote_launch.sh

# The dashboard launcher. Line 1 ignores directories too, and git does not
# look inside an ignored directory -- so the directory has to be un-ignored
# first or the rules below it would never be consulted. Listed file by file
# rather than as dashboard_launcher/*, so a __pycache__ stays ignored.
!dashboard_launcher/
!dashboard_launcher/dashboard_launcher.py
!dashboard_launcher/open_launcher.sh
!dashboard_launcher/rsi-dashboard.desktop

# The virtualenvs themselves are build output -- rebuild them from the
# manifests above, never commit them. Listed after the allowlist so this
# wins, and so a future "!*.py" style rule can't drag in their contents.
.venv-*/

# topaz_imu specific ignores
topaz_imu/.claude
topaz_imu/CLAUDE.md
topaz_imu/main
topaz_imu/sensor_iim42652/iim42652
cphd.py
cphdmeta.py
